      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VELVET LEGEND (1) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by 2 lengths at Murray Bridge Straight in a handy 17.16. Draws the cherry and has a good record over this journey. Can go close again if runs up to latest figure. WATCH AND SEE (4) is a fast dog well performed over the sprint races. Faded to finish fourth over 530m at Angle Park (30.92) in a Grade 6 but is better placed coming back in trip. Form at the trip strong including six wins. Has a solid record from this box including two wins and a minor placing. Key player if finds best. HUNTSMAN (5) is a progressive type who recorded his 27th career win last time out (17.46) at Mt Gambier. Form here sound including three wins. Can measure up again. RIPPIN' PEDRO (8) placed last start in slick time and is in the mix again.",
